          "zh": "微软研究人员利用AI绘制大脑语言区域"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Microsoft researchers introduced generative causal testing to translate black box models into clear hypotheses and verify them in brain scanners, identifying specific brain regions responding to language.",
          "zh": "微软研究人员引入了生成式因果测试，将黑箱模型转化为清晰的假设，并在扫描仪中验证这些假设，从而揭示特定大脑区域对语言的反应。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Researchers introduced generative causal testing.",
            "This method translates black box models into clear hypotheses.",
            "The hypotheses are verified in a scanner, revealing specific brain regions that respond to language."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "研究人员引入了生成式因果测试。",
            "该方法将黑箱模型转化为清晰的假设。",
            "这些假设在扫描仪中得到验证，揭示了对语言作出反应的特定大脑区域。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development provides a method for interpreting complex AI models in neuroscience, enhancing understanding of brain function related to language. It also demonstrates a new approach to verify AI-derived hypotheses through empirical testing.",
          "zh": "这一进展提供了一种在神经科学中解释复杂AI模型的方法，增强了对大脑语言相关功能的理解。它还展示了一种通过实证测试验证AI衍生假设的新方法。"
        },
        "source": "Microsoft Research",
        "link": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/understanding-the-brain-with-ai-driven-explanations-and-experiments/"
